Z||000001||Fformula88||07-16-2001||04:52 PM||||Yeah, it sure is nice for Pontiac to go ahead and remember the Fiero by making it the August car of the month.  They wanted to honor it so much they went ahead and used the ultra rare 84 Fiero "Zm4" model.  So rare in fact, they don't even have a picture... hence the 84 Indy pace car pictured!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  I just wanna know why the ZTO isn't a car of the month too!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>With the number of well liked and recognized nameplates from GM, it is nice to see they made the Fiero a car of the month.  However, you'd think they'd bother to get the model correct.  <P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierosig2.JPG"> <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
